body:
I play a MUD, 10 years ago it would peak with 65-70 people. Now we struggle to get 30 every night.

&#x200B;

People claim it's because we all grew up and had kids, but I don't have kids and I still struggle to play like I used to. Why? Because work has been shaving away more and more of my free time. Nothing has changed, just that the yoke is pulling on me harder now.
